        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_103253/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng đang nhảy qua hàng rào."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "These are eight rhinos.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
