        "text_en": "These are nine wolves.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_103253/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây là chín con sói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They are howling.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_103253/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng đang hú."
      },
